# @hub-lanes

# ── DEAD-LOG LANE (BH-8417) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every 15 minutes. Reads catalog/log-freshness.d/*.tsv (one row per log: path,
# expected cadence, owning lane, reader) and judges each log by its newest
# stamped line (else its mtime). Past LOG_FRESHNESS_MULT (3) x the cadence is
# ONE ALERTS line per (log, stale-since day) naming the owning lane; a missing
# log is one `absent` line a day. One summary line in logs/log-freshness.log.
# Reads only; no lock. Off: flags/lane-off-log-freshness
# (bin/harness-ctl.sh off log-freshness).
*/15 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/log-freshness.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
